\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogens is crucial for the Aldol reaction.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Statement II:</strong> Reaction between benzaldehyde and ethanal will NOT give Cross-Aldol product.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is incorrect. Benzaldehyde (which lacks an <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogen) can indeed react with ethanal (which has an <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogen) in a Cross-Aldol reaction. In a Cross-Aldol reaction, one molecule (ethanal) forms an enolate and reacts with another molecule (benzaldehyde), resulting in the formation of a Cross-Aldol product.</p>\n\n<p>Based on these explanations, the most appropriate answer is:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option B</strong></p>\n\n<p>Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u094b \u0915\u0925\u0928 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0939\u0948\u0902 :</p>\n<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 I : \u0910\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094b\u0902 \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u0915\u0940\u091f\u093e\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0910\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u091c\u093f\u092e\u094d\u092e\u0947\u0926\u093e\u0930 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 II : \u092c\u0948\u0928\u094d\u091c\u0948\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921 \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u0910\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0948\u0932 \u0915\u0940 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0938 \u0910\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n<p>\u0909\u092a\u0930\u094d\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0925\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0930\u094d\u092d \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0930\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0909\u092a\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902 :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"\u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u092a\u0930\u0928\u094d\u0924\u0941 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964"},{"identifier":"C","content":"\u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948 \u092a\u0930\u0928\u094d\u0924\u0941 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964\n"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>\u0906\u0907\u090f \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0915\u0925\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0932\u0947\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902:</p>\n\n<p><strong>\u0915\u0925\u0928 I:</strong> \u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u0947 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932\u0924\u093e \u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930\u0926\u093e\u092f\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n\n<p>\u092f\u0939 \u0915\u0925\u0928 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932\u0940\u092f <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0909\u092a\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0924\u093f \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923 \u0907\u0928 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091f\u094b\u0928\u0940\u0915\u0930\u0923 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u093e \u0938\u0902\u092d\u0935 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u090f\u0928\u094b\u0932\u0947\u091f \u092c\u0928\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u092f\u0947 \u090f\u0928\u094b\u0932\u0947\u091f \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f \u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921 \u092f\u093e \u0915\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092c\u094b\u0928\u093f\u0932 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092c\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0906\u0915\u094d\u0930\u092e\u0923 \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0926 \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u092e\u093e\u0923 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932\u0924\u093e \u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n\n<p><strong>\u0915\u0925\u0928 II:</strong> \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0948\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u0940\u091a \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0938-\u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0917\u0940\u0964</p>\n\n<p>\u092f\u0939 \u0915\u0925\u0928 \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0948\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921 (\u091c\u093f\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948) \u0935\u093e\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0935 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0932 (\u091c\u093f\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0928 \u0939\u0948) \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0938-\u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0938-\u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902, \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u0923\u0941 (\u090f\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0932) \u090f\u0928\u094b\u0932\u0947\u091f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0926\u0942\u0938\u0930\u0947 \u0905\u0923\u0941 (\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0948\u0932\u094d\u0921\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921) \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e\u0938\u094d\u0935\u0930\u0942\u092a \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0938-\u090f\u0932\u094d\u0921\u094b\u0932 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0926 \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u092e\u093e\u0923 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n\n<p>\u0907\u0928 \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f\u0940\u0915\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0906\u0927\u093e\u0930 \u092a\u0930, \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0909\u092a\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u0939\u0948:</p>\n\n<p><strong>\u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a B</strong></p>\n\n<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"chemical-reactions-for-aldehydes-and-ketones","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["assertion_reason"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-4th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>Let's analyze the given statements in detail:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Statement I:</strong> Acidity of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogens of aldehydes and ketones is responsible for Aldol reaction.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is correct. The presence of acidic <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogens in aldehydes and ketones makes it possible for these compounds to undergo deprotonation, forming enolates. These enolates can then attack the carbonyl carbon of another aldehyde or ketone, leading to the formation of the Aldol product. Therefore, the acidity of the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogens is crucial for the Aldol reaction.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Statement II:</strong> Reaction between benzaldehyde and ethanal will NOT give Cross-Aldol product.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is incorrect. Benzaldehyde (which lacks an <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogen) can indeed react with ethanal (which has an <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-hydrogen) in a Cross-Aldol reaction. In a Cross-Aldol reaction, one molecule (ethanal) forms an enolate and reacts with another molecule (benzaldehyde), resulting in the formation of a Cross-Aldol product.</p>\n\n<p>Based on these explanations, the most appropriate answer is:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option B</strong></p>\n\n<p>Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect.</p>","qKey":"pgiven-below-are-two-statements-p-pstatements-i--ac-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-6gfzjt7phjjakjio","paperKey":"jee-main-2024-online-4th-april-morning-shift"}]}